  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_1963.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La avenida profesor Eulogio Oset de Ribesalbes ha acogido la ma&ntilde;ana de este domingo, 20 de julio, una trobada de las escuelas de ciclismo de la provincia de Castell&oacute;n, organizada por el Club Ciclista Sepelaco de Onda.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaribesalbesescolesciclisme/img_1963.jpg\" alt=\"img_1963\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaribesalbesescolesciclisme/img_1964.jpg\" alt=\"img_1964\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaribesalbesescolesciclisme/img_1965.jpg\" alt=\"img_1965\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaribesalbesescolesciclisme/img_1966.jpg\" alt=\"img_1966\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaribesalbesescolesciclisme/img_1967.jpg\" alt=\"img_1967\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaribesalbesescolesciclisme/img_1968.jpg\" alt=\"img_1968\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaribesalbesescolesciclisme/img_1969.jpg\" alt=\"img_1969\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaribesalbesescolesciclisme/img_1972.jpg\" alt=\"img_1972\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trob